Re: Linking message [was: Re: Patch to complete a change...],kchrist@lsil.com,"Fri, 13 Sep 2002 09:14:58 -0600","In message <200209130231.g8D2VO021580@hobbit.linuxworks.com.au.nospam>, Tony Nu
gent writes:
