Re: [SAtalk] O.T. Habeus -- Why?,Skip Montanaro <skip@pobox.com>,"Thu, 29 Aug 2002 00:44:53 -0500","DanQ> I think it would make more sense to start Habeas with a less
    DanQ> aggressive score (one which will not give spammers a quick path
    DanQ> into everyone's inbox) and after we've seen evidence that the
