Re: [Razor-users] Razor with sendmail,Theo Van Dinter <felicity@kluge.net>,"Fri, 23 Aug 2002 15:10:02 -0400","On Fri, Aug 23, 2002 at 03:03:05PM -0400, Rose, Bobby wrote:
