Re: [SAtalk] Can someone please tell me how to get an answer from    this list?,Bart Schaefer <schaefer@zanshin.com>,"Mon, 16 Sep 2002 11:19:19 -0700","On Mon, 16 Sep 2002, Justin Mason wrote:

> Simon Matthews said:
> 
> > Procmail 3.21 is reliable as long as none of the recipies fails. I was 
> > hoping to resolve the triplets.txt problem and thus avoid the procmail 
> > ""^rom"" problem. 
> 
> I doubt it's related, actually -- the ""triplets"" stuff is in a totally
