Selling Wedded Bliss (was Re: Ouch...),"""Adam L. Beberg"" <beberg@mithral.com>","Thu, 05 Sep 2002 19:07:40 -0700","...an alternative to the ""kind of de-feminized, over-sized, self-centered,
