Re: Recommended Viewing,Gary Lawrence Murphy <garym@canada.com>,"Mon, 09 Sep 2002 23:16:01 -0400",">>>>> ""G"" == Geege Schuman <geege@barrera.org> writes:

    G> ...  i'm sure it's some neurochemical process initiated during
