To download iSiloX 3.2b1 for Mac OS, please go to this URL:

    <http://www.iSiloX.com/info/beta/iSiloXMac.htm>


======================================================================
4. iSiloXC 3.2 for Windows, Linux, FreeBSD, Mac OS X,
