A better investment than the stock market.,zzzz@webnote.net,"Mon, 02 Sep 2002 02:56:26 -0500","All our mailings are sent complying to the proposed H.R. 3113 Unsolicited
Commercial Electronic Mail Act of 2000. Please see the bottom of this
