Re: [scoop] Scoop MS Word .doc file into something that plucker or other Palm app can display?,unlisted <unlisted@pobox.com>,"Fri, 30 Aug 2002 08:50:38 -0500","On Thu, 2002-08-29 at 19:27, Barry Dexter A. Gonzaga wrote:
