[use Perl] Stories for 2002-10-08,pudge@perl.org,"Tue, 08 Oct 2002 02:00:35 +0000","use Perl Daily Newsletter

In this issue:
    * This Week on perl5-porters (30 September / 6 October 2002)
    * RATS

+--------------------------------------------------------------------+
| This Week on perl5-porters (30 September / 6 October 2002)         |
