More on promiscuity and word choice Re: Selling Wedded Bliss (was    Re: Ouch...),Gordon Mohr <gojomo@usa.net>,"Tue, 10 Sep 2002 13:45:17 -0700","Robert Harley writes:
> >OK, then. Consider a population of 1,000,000. 500,000 men each
