Re: EBusiness Webforms: cluetrain has left the station,Gary Lawrence Murphy <garym@canada.com>,"Sat, 28 Sep 2002 15:54:42 -0400",">>>>> ""G"" == Gregory Alan Bolcer <gbolcer@endeavors.com> writes:

