Property rights in the 3rd World (De Soto's Mystery of Capital),John Hall <johnhall@evergo.net>,"Thu, 22 Aug 2002 13:02:45 -0700","> From: fork-admin@xent.com [mailto:fork-admin@xent.com] On Behalf Of
Dave
> Long
> Sent: Thursday, August 22, 2002 11:12 AM
