Re: New Sequences Window,Robert Elz <kre@munnari.OZ.AU>,"Wed, 28 Aug 2002 21:44:26 +0700","Date:        Wed, 28 Aug 2002 09:22:34 -0500
    From:        Chris Garrigues <cwg-dated-1030976555.34ad5b@DeepEddy.Com>
