Re: [SAtalk] spamc -c problems on 2.41?,Theo Van Dinter <felicity@kluge.net>,"Fri, 13 Sep 2002 15:10:31 -0400","On Thu, Sep 12, 2002 at 01:47:27PM -0700, Jeremy Kusnetz wrote:
> When running:
> spamc -c < sample-spam.txt
