Re: [ILUG] Sparc Solaris (was: Dell GX260 V Redhat 7.3),"""John P. Looney"" <valen@tuatha.org>","Tue, 06 Aug 2002 13:06:57 +0100","On Tue, Aug 06, 2002 at 12:56:17PM +0100, kevin lyda mentioned:
