Re: [ILUG] SUSE 8 disks? (thread changed slightly),"""John P. Looney"" <valen@tuatha.org>","Tue, 13 Aug 2002 08:38:47 +0100","On Tue, Aug 13, 2002 at 01:40:21AM +0200, Paul Linehan mentioned:
