Re: [ILUG] hwclock,Michael Conry <michael.conry@ucd.ie>,"Tue, 20 Aug 2002 00:45:46 +0100","On 0020 +0100 %{!Mon, Aug 19, 2002 at 11:30:12PM +0100}, Anthony wrote:
> to the net. However, I didn't realise that Windows altered the hw clock
