RE: Documentation about built-in RPM macros?,"""Harig, Mark A."" <maharig@idirect.net>","Thu, 15 Aug 2002 15:30:40 -0400","> -----Original Message-----
> From: Ralf Ertzinger [mailto:ralf@camperquake.de]
