> 	 

 	
 	 	 	
 	
 	  
Serving Sara
A wealthy bombshell enlists a process server to help her bring down her
nasty husband in a divorce settlement.
 	 
 	
 	
 <http://www.tribute.ca/movie_spec/2574.htm?newsletter=number48>
